    "detailed_description": "<strong>Play as a Cactus Hunter. Your job? Hunt down killer cacti!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601420/extras/1dccbc471be0414b5dd9565c4c86ca31.poster.avif?t=1748280730\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601420/extras/1dccbc471be0414b5dd9565c4c86ca31.webm?t=1748280730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601420/extras/1dccbc471be0414b5dd9565c4c86ca31.mp4?t=1748280730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the of killer cacti infested open-world with your truck.</strong></h2>Explore the open-world to loot some lost treasures. Your truck is with you, <br>which loads your valuables. But take care, the killer cacti are out there.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get hired as a Cactus Hunter.</strong></h2>It's your job to hunt down the killer cacti which terrorize the villagers. They're gonna reward you with some nice car upgrades and gold.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend your earnings on new weapons and traps.</strong></h2>Spend your earnings on new weapons or traps at local dealers and become a better Cactus Hunter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather a team to execute the cactus wipe out plan.</strong></h2>Gather a team of the best warriors out there and execute a plan to become the most legendary Cactus Hunter the world has ever known.",
